-- Follow-up on Susan's 2026-10-21 feedback batch, EvoMentor Thuringia.
-- PR #82 flagged 3 rows ([99f77e60], [7857bf1d], [a0c72af6]) as real content
-- gaps needing a dedicated pass rather than a rushed fix. This migration is
-- that pass, after re-checking each claim directly against live production
-- data rather than trusting the earlier flag at face value:
--
-- - [7857bf1d] (Trennverfahren list incomplete) -- confirmed: the existing
--   row only listed 3 of Susan's 6 quoted methods and was missing the
--   "(MB, BO)" interdisciplinary tag. Wording-only fix, same pattern as
--   migration 153.
-- - [99f77e60] (Samenpflanzen extraction) -- re-checked against live data
--   and most of what Susan quoted is ALREADY present as separate rows
--   (Bestäubung, Befruchtung/Fruchtbildung, Keimungsbedingungen, Samenpflanze-
--   Begriff, geschlechtliche/ungeschlechtliche Fortpflanzung all already exist
--   and are 'accepted'). Only 2 genuinely missing: seed structure (Samenschale/
--   Keimling/Speicherstoffe) and the germination-to-growth developmental
--   sequence (Quellung/Keimung/Wachstum). 2 new rows, not a full new batch.
-- - [a0c72af6] (Stoffeigenschaften/Experimente missing) -- confirmed: 3 real
--   Fachpraktische-Arbeiten experiments from the document have no row at all
--   (property determination, particle-movement demo, water-vapor
--   condensation). 3 new rows.
--
-- [7f6208a3] was also re-checked and found already fully correct in live data
-- (exact wording match) -- no SQL change needed, just a feedback-status flip
-- (handled by Dustin via resolve_feedback.mjs, not this migration). Its second
-- half (missing Basiskonzepte/method connections) is a separate, much larger
-- finding -- see this session's design note, not fixed here.

-- [7857bf1d]: Susan's exact quoted wording for the Trennverfahren list.
UPDATE lpm_data_objects
SET description = 'Experimentieren (MB, BO): Trennen von Stoffgemischen:
• Sortieren
